Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This part 10 makes me wonder,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.72,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,why does Pandora's box mean one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,tiny choice can unleash huge\Nconsequences?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I stop sorting screws and reach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,for the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pandora is given a sealed\Ncontainer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and warned not to open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In the earliest Greek version, it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,is actually a jar, not a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But the dangerous idea stays the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,same.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Something forbidden is sitting\Nwithin reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Curiosity wins and Pandora opens\Nit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, Trouble's escape into\Nthe world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,faster than she can contain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She closes the container, but the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,damage is already beyond her\Ncontrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.94,0:00:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one thing remains inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That final detail makes the story
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,more than a simple warning about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pandora's box becomes a symbol for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,decisions that release\Nconsequences you cannot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.26,0:00:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,easily reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:00:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A small action can trigger\Nproblems
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.76,0:01:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,far larger than the action itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.94,0:01:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why we still say
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,someone is opening Pandora's box.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We mean the choice may start
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,a chain of trouble that keeps
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.74,0:01:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The deeper lesson is not just
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,do not be curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.34,0:01:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It is that some doors are
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.46,0:01:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,much easier to open than to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,close.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes the smallest opening\Nchanges everything
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.76,0:01:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,that follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.34,0:01:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Like and subscribe to grow more
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.26,0:01:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
